From 761d982e5102b531c690d3701fc587185452a184 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2025 15:55:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 173/190] drm: xlnx: mixer: Ignore missing dt property

commit d06df6a7a9b375b3f4d1ccd19736ea8bf54eb32f from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Don't fail driver bind if optional "xlnx,disp-bridge" dt property is
missing. This property should be present only if mixer CRTC connected to
the encoder via CSC or scaler. The property is not needed in the case of
direct CRTC to encoder connection.

Signed-off-by: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Vishal Sagar <vishal.sagar@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20251017225527.3662637-2-anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xlnx/xlnx_mixer.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xlnx/xlnx_mixer.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xlnx/xlnx_mixer.c
index fc5a022fdfe3..c08b874d2400 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xlnx/xlnx_mixer.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xlnx/xlnx_mixer.c
@@ -3248,7 +3248,7 @@ static int xlnx_mix_bind(struct device *dev, struct device *master,
 	u32 ret;
 
 	ret = xlnx_mix_dt_dp_bridge(dev, mixer);
-	if (ret)
+	if (ret == -EPROBE_DEFER)
 		return ret;
 
 	mixer->drm = drm;
-- 
